{{define "content"}}
<div class="config-sub" id="page-config-skills">
{{template "config_sub_header" $}}
<h1>Skills</h1>
<p class="sub">
  Coding-agent skill packages discovered on this host — what Grok/Claude load for headless runs.
  User skills under <span class="mono">~/.grok/skills</span> and <span class="mono">~/.claude/skills</span> apply to every project worktree;
  Claude plugins listed in <span class="mono">~/.claude/plugins/installed_plugins.json</span> contribute their <span class="mono">skills/</span> packages (marketplace clones that are not installed stay hidden);
  project skills under each checkout’s <span class="mono">.grok/skills</span> apply only when that repo is the agent cwd.
  This page is read-only; install or edit skills on disk (or via the coding CLI).
</p>

{{if .Skills}}
{{/* Desktop: scrollable table. Phone: stacked m-rows (same pattern as sessions/ship). */}}
<div class="table-scroll m-hide" id="skills-table">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Name</th>
        <th>Source</th>
        <th>Description</th>
        <th>Path</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {{range .Skills}}
      <tr>
        <td class="mono skill-name">{{.Name}}</td>
        <td><span class="badge">{{.Source}}</span></td>
        <td class="skill-desc">{{if .Description}}{{.Description}}{{else}}<span class="muted">—</span>{{end}}</td>
        <td class="mono skill-path" title="{{.Path}}">{{.Path}}</td>
      </tr>
      {{end}}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<div class="m-rows" id="skills-m-rows">
  {{range .Skills}}
  <div class="m-row">
    <div class="m-row-main">
      <div class="m-row-t mono">{{.Name}}</div>
      <div class="m-row-s">{{if .Description}}{{.Description}}{{else}}—{{end}}</div>
      <div class="m-row-s mono skill-path">{{.Path}}</div>
    </div>
    <span class="badge">{{.Source}}</span>
  </div>
  {{end}}
</div>
<p class="sub">{{len .Skills}} skill{{if ne (len .Skills) 1}}s{{end}} · refresh the page after installing new ones</p>
{{else}}
<div class="section card">
  <p class="empty">No skills found under the usual host paths.</p>
  <p class="sub" style="margin:0">
    Install a user skill at <span class="mono">~/.grok/skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md</span>
    (Claude: <span class="mono">~/.claude/skills/</span>), install a Claude plugin whose
    <span class="mono">skills/</span> packages land under
    <span class="mono">~/.claude/plugins/</span>, or add extra roots in
    <span class="mono">~/.grok/config.toml</span> under <span class="mono">[skills] paths</span>.
    This repo also vendors <span class="mono">.grok/skills/scrutinize</span> for agents working on grokwork itself.
  </p>
</div>
{{end}}
</div>
{{end}}
